# `legacy/` is its own cargo workspace (cutover-plan 5.0), so it builds into its
# own `target/` — the root `.gitignore`'s `/target` is anchored and does not
# reach it. Same shape as `crates/wingfoil-wasm/.gitignore`, for the same
# reason.
#
# `Cargo.lock` is deliberately NOT ignored here: this workspace is a set of
# published crates plus a cdylib, and the lockfile is committed for the same
# reproducibility reason the root one is.
target/
